SUMMARY:UCHE YARA (aut) + CUTE AGGRESSION (aut) *AUSVERKAUFT* (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Arena
DESCRIPTION:BODYSCANNER Tour 26 | Arena Wien - Kleine Halle | Das Konzert ist ausverkauft!  BODYSCANNER Tour 26  UCHE YARA: A post-club experience  UCHE YARA’s music is raw\, electrifying\, and deeply emotional. Fusing influences from alt pop\, R&B and club music she creates a unique sonic universe ranging from hypnotic intensity to delicate intimacy.  On stage\, UCHE is a one-woman force of sound and movement: with her voice\, guitar\, and body as instruments she builds something truly magnetic\, blurring the lines between live performance and club experience.  BODYSCANNER – the debut album of UCHE YARA – feels like a club record viewed from an unexpected angle. It explores the tension between how we perceive ourselves from within and how we are constantly scanned\, judged\, and interpreted by the outside world. It reflects the intimate act of turning that scanner inward — observing your own body\, identity\, and emotions with the same intensity.  A must see for everyone drawn to left-field pop\, R&B\, club culture\, and movement. https://ucheyara.webflow.io/   Cute Aggression make music. Music you'll like. Or not. They don't care. Come see Cute Aggression play a show. They play synthesizers and drum machines and guitars and stuff. Or they don't. Maybe they'll just play with your expectations.  For this special solo show\, you will see one half of the duo\, Aaron Abebe\, remix their own songs live on modular synthesizers adding breakbeats\, distorted guitars and chopped vocals.  This year saw the release of their debut album "Make Us Crash". Falter called it "the most remarkable domestic record of the moment." Ten songs in a genre-blending mix between cute and aggression - spanning Hyperpop\, Indierock\, Industrial\, Jungle\, and Post-Punk. https://cuteaggression.lol/   Vorverkauf/Presale Arena Shop € 29 (inkl. Fee) Abendkassa/Box-office tba. 
URL:https://arena.wien/Home/Programm-Detail/concert-id/48590
